  "operation": "Port original path sequence, movement and blocked playables, timers, direction, source/target binding and transform restoration. The shared presentation clock supplies each original update delta and action lifetime; local action snapshots, entity lookup and the existing entity-slot coordinates replace server component access. Current EC and older Mono views share one clock interface; the original Mono shell delegates when its EC view is present. A local BlockedAction parameter identifies existing collision receipts without changing authored direction."
